cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "channel-design: substrate-channel measurement inside an enzyme redesign loop"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline for widening the substrate access channel of unspecific
  peroxygenases. Boltz-2 structure and affinity prediction, AutoDock Vina
  docking, fpocket/CAVER pocket and tunnel analysis, and RFdiffusion3 partial
  diffusion with LigandMPNN and RF3, with CAVER tunnel measurement wired into
  the design loop so that channel geometry selects the residues to redesign,
  gates backbones before GPU work, and scores the folded designs.
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://gitlab.igem.org/2026/software/dtu-denmark/channel-design"
date-released: 2026-09-26
version: "1.0.0"
keywords:
  - unspecific peroxygenase
  - protein design
  - substrate channel
  - CAVER
  - RFdiffusion
  - iGEM
